      "standardized_narrative": "At 1 January 2022 the syndicate carried gross claims outstanding of GBP 789.8m. During 2022 there was a material gross strengthening of prior years of approximately GBP 139.7m, driven predominantly by the syndicate's provisioning for indirect losses arising from the Russian invasion of Ukraine (gross indirect reserves of GBP 138.3m, of which 93% were allocated to the 2021 year of account) together with other adverse developments on prior years (notably deterioration on certain casualty portfolios and legacy large losses). The movement represents a portfolio-wide adverse development (strengthening), with casualty and aviation/reinsurance lines most affected. Some prior-year items such as Florida contractors litigation were quantified on a net basis in the report but gross figures were not disclosed.",
      "raw_causal_phrases": [
        "This has resulted in gross reserves of GBP 138.3m, GBP 39.2m net of reinsurance, included in the financial results for the year ended 31 December 2022.",
        "The loss reserve is split 93% to the 2021 year of account and 7% to the 2022 year of account.",
        "The most significant movement in claims during the last 12 months impacting the 2020 and prior years was an influx of lawsuits related to Florida construction defects.",
        "The total of additional reserves added to the prior years for claims notified or IBNR related to this issue amounts to $27.0m net in the calendar year.",
        "There was also a significant deterioration on the Boeing loss during 2022 which impacts the Aviation Reinsurance account for the 2019 year of account.",
        "The Naga 7 loss ... is now reserved at $10.0m net to Atrium.",
        "Direct losses reserved for amount to GBP 21.1m gross and GBP 8.7m net of reinsurance as at 31 December 2022."
