      "data_quality_notes": "Prior year development (gross) was calculated by combining (a) the explicitly stated gross indirect reserves of GBP 138.3m (93% allocated to 2021 YOA gross strengthening GBP 128.619m) which are explicitly disclosed in the report, with (b) the gross movement derived from the published gross claims development triangle for underwriting years 2013-2020 (+GBP 11.071m). Some specific reserve impacts are quoted only on a net (post-reinsurance) basis or in USD in narrative (e.g. Florida construction defects $27.0m net, Hurricane Ian $35.8m gross/$32.3m net in USD); those USD/net figures were NOT converted to the report currency or used as gross amounts. Gross prior-year movement therefore reflects the major disclosed gross strengthening item (Ukraine aircraft) plus the triangle-derived movement for older years. Where only net amounts or USD amounts were provided, gross equivalents were not available and so are left null. The claims triangle excludes the aggregated '2012 & prior' column by design. [RAG OVERRIDE: Model said PYD=139.69, RAG triangle computed 11.071. Using RAG value.]",
